graph TD
    subgraph EdgeDevice ["ESP32-S3 Edge Computing Hub (N16R8)"]
        subgraph AudioInference ["Core 1: Audio & TinyML Engine"]
            INMP441["Micro I2S INMP441"] -->|I2S Bus GPIO 4,5,6| I2S_Driver["I2S DMA Driver"]
