            LimitSwitches["Limit Switches (GPIO 38,3) + Open Btn (GPIO 47)"] --> DoorSecurity
            
            IntentDispatcher --> Relays["Relays (Lights GPIO 41, Fan GPIO 42, Yard GPIO 40)"]
